WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Invite an entry. A comment starts an opening DM. The person responds to enter.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Keep one entry per person. The same contact cannot redraw by repeating the trigger.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Choose the probabilities. A random split chooses an outcome for each entry.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Explain the outcome. This can select zero or several people, not exactly one winner.
